{"id": "factor-cross-section", "prompt": "对 close 做 factor_cross_sectional_analysis 与 factor_quintile_returns，说明多空分层是否单调，结论含 IC 或 分层", "expected_tools": ["factor_cross_sectional_analysis", "factor_quintile_returns"], "forbidden_tools": ["write"], "toolset": "factor_analyst", "must_contain": ["IC|分层|quintile"], "tags": ["factor"]}
{"id": "factor-compute-only", "prompt": "只用 compute_factor 计算 ts_std(close,20) 波动因子，不要做完整分析", "expected_tools": ["compute_factor"], "forbidden_tools": ["run_backtest", "write"], "toolset": "factor_analyst", "tags": ["factor"]}
{"id": "market-data-only", "prompt": "用 get_market_data 拉取 3 只股票日线，并用 search_symbol 确认代码；不要写文件", "expected_tools": ["get_market_data"], "forbidden_tools": ["write"], "toolset": "chat", "tags": ["data"]}
{"id": "list-files-survey", "prompt": "用 list_files 列出工作区顶层目录结构，再 read 任意一个文本文件并复述要点", "expected_tools": ["list_files", "read"], "forbidden_tools": ["write"], "toolset": "minimal", "budget_max_tokens": 3000, "tags": ["minimal"]}
{"id": "backtest-strategy-name-required", "prompt": "调用 run_backtest 时若缺少 strategy_name 应给出可操作错误，然后用 Demo 策略名尝试执行", "expected_tools": ["run_backtest"], "forbidden_tools": ["run_bg_command"], "toolset": "backtest_diagnostics", "tags": ["backtest", "error"]}
{"id": "compare-strategies", "prompt": "用 strategy_compare 或 list_history 对比两个策略 run 的差异，不要执行新回测", "expected_tools": ["list_history"], "forbidden_tools": ["run_backtest"], "toolset": "backtest_diagnostics", "tags": ["backtest"]}
{"id": "drawdown-review", "prompt": "用 drawdown_analysis 或 read 分析最大回撤区间，结论提到 回撤|MDD|drawdown 之一", "expected_tools": ["read"], "forbidden_tools": ["write"], "toolset": "backtest_diagnostics", "must_contain": ["回撤|MDD|drawdown"], "tags": ["backtest"]}
{"id": "write-strategy-file", "prompt": "用 write 在 strategies/ 下写一个 strategy.py 草稿，包含 PARAMS 与 FACTOR_EXPRS", "expected_tools": ["write"], "forbidden_tools": ["run_bg_command"], "toolset": "strategist", "tags": ["strategy", "write"]}
