{"id": "researcher-web", "prompt": "用 websearch 查找 A 股动量因子研究要点，再结合 factor_analysis 给出三条可验证假设，结论含 假设|hypothesis", "expected_tools": ["websearch", "factor_analysis"], "forbidden_tools": ["write"], "toolset": "researcher", "must_contain": ["假设|hypothesis"], "tags": ["research"]}
